\":{}},\"is_error\":false,\"num_turns\":2,\"subtype\":\"success\",\"api_error_status\":null,\"result\":\"{\\\"findings\\\":[\\\"Requested check 'Linux and native success conjunction' is not evidenced in either file. bootstrap_controller.rs::Controller::finish() returns success/exit status derived solely from the native child process (WaitForSingleObject + child.wait()), with no reference to the Linux subject's outcome. cross_os_reset.rs::Subject::finish() unconditionally copies the enumerated mailbox files (including seal.json) to the evidence directory without inspecting seal.json's contents or otherwise asserting Linux-side success. Neither file cross-references the other's success/failure state, so the conjunction of Linux and native success cannot be confirmed from this evidence; if it exists it must live in code not provided here.\\\"],\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Primary-role/finite-timeout validation before spawn, ordinary Job containment (no breakaway/detached launch), and narrow enumerated mailbox export all check out against the provided evidence. The one requested property that could not be confirmed is the conjunction of Linux-subject and native-controller success — neither file ties the two outcomes together.\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"findings\\\"}\",\"structured_output\":{\"findings\":[\"Requested check 'Linux and native success conjunction' is not evidenced in either file. bootstrap_controller.rs::Controller::finish() returns success/exit status derived solely from the native child process (WaitForSingleObject + child.wait()), with no reference to the Linux subject's outcome. cross_os_reset.rs::Subject::finish() unconditionally copies the enumerated mailbox files (including seal.json) to the evidence directory without inspecting seal.json's contents or otherwise asserting Linux-side success. Neither file cross-references the other's success/failure state, so the conjunction of Linux and native success cannot be confirmed from this evidence; if it exists it must live in code not provided here.\"],\"summary\":\"Primary-role/finite-timeout validation before spawn, ordinary Job containment (no breakaway/detached launch), and narrow enumerated mailbox export all check out against the provided evidence. The one requested property that could not be confirmed is the conjunction of Linux-subject and native-controller success — neither file ties the two outcomes together.\\\"\",\"verdict\":\"findings\"},\"ttft_ms\":30698,\"type\":\"result\",\"duration_ms\":34364,\"uuid\":\"42de0ded-130e-48c7-bea0-ee6842ea1c48\",\"ttft_stream_ms\":1272,\"time_to_request_ms\":41,\"first_content_frame_ms\":1554,\"queued_turn_count\":0}\n",
